WEBVTT

00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:02.890
Tada!

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:06.900
This is summer's gift to you.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:10.190
It wants you to remember winter.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:15.700
And this...

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.280
is <i>my</i> gift to you.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.130
Now you can beat fate.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:32.880
Give it a try.

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:34.930
Only good answers will be waiting for you.

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:41.390
Now fate's on <i>our</i> side.

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:48.610
You have to say 1 2 3 before you take it, okay?

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:49.730
Okay.

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:18.840
There's only one left.

00:01:19.850 --> 00:01:21.510
Time to take one of you.

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:23.770
Look at the camera.

00:01:25.230 --> 00:01:26.310
I don't need one of me.

00:01:30.110 --> 00:01:31.510
Smile.

00:01:31.510 --> 00:01:33.280
You look better that way.

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:36.170
Now,

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:39.820
Say "Kimchi!"

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:39.690
What happened to your necklace?

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:50.450
The link on this thing looks really strong, doesn't it?

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:53.990
But it started giving me trouble as soon as the person who gave it to me

00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:55.500
caused me trouble as well.

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:59.050
I'll fix it for you.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:00.090
Let me see.

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:01.510
I see you have a conscience.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:02.470
Of course.

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:05.590
You've got to promise me that you'll give it back soon, okay?

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:07.050
Yeah.

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:13.690
Don't you think it'll get cold at night?

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:36.460
I'm going outside for a bit.

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:58.730
I'm not scared of anything anymore.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.070
I'm really not.

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:03.760
As long as I have you,

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:05.200
nothing scares me.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:19.420
How did you find out?

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:24.880
Did your father know all along?

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:26.760
Yeah.

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:28.940
I see.

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:31.220
So everyone knew already.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:32.900
What are you going to do now?

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:35.050
I don't know;

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:36.560
what should I do?

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:39.600
Should I just run away with Yujin to some place no one will find us?

00:05:41.060 --> 00:05:43.110
Would you let us go?

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:45.280
Joonsang...

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:17.500
<i>Give it a try.</i>

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:19.440
<i>Only good answers will be waiting for you.</i>

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:23.020
<i>Now fate's on </i>our<i> side.</i>

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:52.400
How did you know we were here?

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:53.890
Where's Joonsang?

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:56.810
Have you seen him?

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:58.310
Yujin.

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:01.480
Where's Joonsang?

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:04.610
He left.

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:07.620
Don't lie to me!

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:08.860
Why would he?

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:11.320
Why would he leave?

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:13.540
Because of his mother.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:16.990
He said he couldn't put his mother through any more pain.

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:20.830
No, that's impossible.

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:23.420
It's true.

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:25.800
He said that he was leaving you,

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:27.750
and that he was never going to see you again.

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:31.720
That's what he told me to tell you before he left.

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:34.800
That's impossible!

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:06.250
Have you heard from Sanghyuk, by any chance?

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:08.420
From Sanghyuk? Why?

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:10.510
I haven't been able to get a hold of him since yesterday.

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:13.180
He's been acting strange lately;

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:17.760
I wonder if he's acting like this because of Yujin.

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:22.020
You don't think he's seeing her again, do you?

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:27.030
Don't worry, he wouldn't do that.

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:32.280
Then, do you know why Sanghyuk's acting like this?

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:34.910
Why on earth is he acting like this?

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:39.330
Could you tell Sanghyuk to come talk to me when he comes back?

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:44.540
<i>Do you know what the difference between you and Hyeonsoo is?</i>

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:47.820
<i>People in love tend to exhibit this quality</i>

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:50.420
<i>where they unconditionally believe everything their partner says.</i>

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:53.090
<i>You loved me,</i>

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:55.760
<i>but Hyeonsoo didn't.</i>

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:57.890
<i>That's the difference between you two.</i>

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:11.610
How long has Joonsang known

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:13.940
that he and Yujin are siblings?

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:20.490
I think he found out when he regained his memories not too long ago.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:21.990
His memories?

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:27.080
Then he must have known about it before the accident.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:28.790
Yes.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:32.090
He's decided not to see her anymore.

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:34.260
I-I see.

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:36.170
After they went through all that trouble to see each other again.

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:40.470
It must be hard for him to accept this.

00:09:40.940 --> 00:09:42.100
Even I have a hard time believing it.

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:44.810
Perhaps I shouldn't have let Yujin go.

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:47.440
At least, I wouldn't have done it,

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:49.100
if I had known things would turn out this way.

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:53.480
I'm going back to my room.

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:59.700
Shouldn't Joonsang and Yujin be different ages, then?

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:01.320
How are they the same age?

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:03.200
I have no idea.

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:05.830
They're both the same age.

00:10:06.450 --> 00:10:10.130
Even their birthdays are only a month or two apart from each other.

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:12.630
Now that I think about it,

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:16.090
those two have so many things in common.

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:18.090
Father?

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:23.280
Oh, it's nothing.

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:24.890
Go on back to your room.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.820
Here you go, Mother. {it's customary for daughter-in-laws to refer to their mother-in-laws as "mother"... the "Mrs. Kim" approach doesn't work here because of the next line}

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:43.410
You shouldn't be calling me "Mother" anymore, don't you think?

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:46.370
I'm sorry.

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:49.500
If it's about the marriage, there's nothing for you to be sorry about.

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:52.880
I'm not here to scold you about that.

00:10:53.640 --> 00:10:56.550
Why do you keep seeing Sanghyuk?

00:10:56.790 --> 00:10:57.880
Is Sanghyuk...

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:01.970
the kind of guy you call for help when you're in need

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:04.720
and just ignore when you don't need him?

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:09.890
I heard that you and that man from the ski resort broke up.

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:14.610
Yes, I'm sure it was surprising and a lot for you to take in,

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:19.190
but I won't forgive you if you confuse or try to see Sanghyuk again

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:21.500
just because things are a little difficult for you.

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:23.450
Things are already over between you and Sanghyuk.

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:27.200
Even if you and that Joonsang boy are little more than siblings,

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:29.540
I won't let you get back together with Sanghyuk.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:34.080
What did you just say?

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:38.100
I heard that you and Joonsang are siblings.

00:11:38.100 --> 00:11:39.860
It's surprising, I know,

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:42.220
but that's no excuse for you and Sanghyuk to...

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:45.260
What did you just say?

00:11:45.990 --> 00:11:48.600
Joonsang and I are what?

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:51.230
Please tell me one more time.

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:54.520
You didn't know?

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:58.940
What did you say?

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:09.580
You're looking for Joonsang?

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:13.580
I'm looking for him too.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.210
I haven't been able to get in touch with him for a few days.

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:18.840
Is it true?

00:12:19.570 --> 00:12:20.800
Is it?

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:26.470
Is Joonsang really my father's son?

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:29.640
Is he?

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:32.890
He isn't, right?

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:37.310
Please tell me he isn't.

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:43.030
Please tell me he's not!

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:46.360
Give up on Joonsang.

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:48.990
Please.

00:12:50.530 --> 00:12:52.250
Please pretend that nothing ever happened between you two.

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:53.460
Joonsang's...

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:57.250
Ms. Yujin?

00:13:05.670 --> 00:13:06.630
Don't let anyone in;

00:13:06.630 --> 00:13:08.050
I don't want to take any calls either.

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:18.310
It's me, Joonsang Kang.

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:21.570
I was wondering if I could ask you something, Professor.

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:23.500
Why are you doing this?

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:25.700
The Director's currently out of the office—

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:33.040
It's okay, just leave us alone.

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:35.540
I'll see you at the university, then.

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:41.880
What brings you here?

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:45.050
Didn't Sanghyuk tell you what I said?

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.930
I thought I told him that I'm leaving you.

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:53.260
I'm also going back to America now.

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:56.100
Joonsang.

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:59.040
There's nothing you can do about it now.

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:00.360
Don't waste your time.

00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:02.400
But why?

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:04.110
Why can't we do anything about it?

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:07.740
I don't love you.

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:11.070
I... don't love you.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:13.580
Liar.

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:14.870
I'm being honest.

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:16.960
You're lying!

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:20.690
You know you're lying.

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:22.250
You love me.

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:23.880
Can't we just...

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:27.970
Can't we just love each other?

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:29.090
Don't tell me, you...

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:31.590
Is it true?

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:36.020
Is it?

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:37.640
Yujin...

00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:40.900
Tell me, is it true?

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:50.530
Yujin!

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:51.910
Stay away.

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:56.120
Stay away.

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:04.130
How far are you on your report?

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:05.840
I'm done with it.

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:10.300
I thought I asked you to wait inside?

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:17.060
Why did my father abandon my mother?

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:20.730
You know the reason, don't you, Professor?

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:27.700
Are you all right?

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:28.940
You don't look too well.

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:31.280
Please tell me.

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:33.030
Hey!

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:34.910
Joonsang!

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:45.790
Will he be okay, Doctor?

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.380
I assume you're his father?

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:49.170
Excuse me?

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:58.500
What brings you here?

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:01.350
You wouldn't be here just to visit, since you're so busy.

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:03.550
You're right.

00:16:03.550 --> 00:16:05.360
I'm here because I wanted to ask you something.

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:06.900
What is it?

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:09.360
It's kinda scary when you ask like that.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:13.360
Yujin and Joonsang are having some sort of problem, aren't they?

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:17.370
Jinsook told me.

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:26.250
Sorry.

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:27.500
Hello?

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:28.380
Yes, Father.

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:29.420
What?

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:32.470
Joonsang's in the hospital?

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:33.700
Yeah.

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:35.930
They think it's some sort of traumatic aftereffect from the accident.

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:43.060
Let's see you if you can keep making trouble while I do this!

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:46.350
They're going to have to check him again to be sure.

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:48.060
He just fell asleep.

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:50.110
The doctor will see you now.

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:55.360
He needs to be stabilized for now.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:59.370
His body and mind are currently exhausted from stress.

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:03.580
We'll have to wait for the test results to be sure.

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:07.540
Anyway, as the patient's father, you have nothing to worry about.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:12.380
It's best to let him rest for now.

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:14.840
That's all I have for you at the moment.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:17.090
Could I...

00:17:36.170 --> 00:17:37.030
Father.

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:39.120
Joonsang...

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.500
Don't tell Mi Hee about this.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:53.050
Joonsang pleaded with me not to.

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:53.850
I understand.

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:55.260
I'm going to leave now.

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:56.340
Yes, Father.

00:17:57.340 --> 00:18:00.970
What do you think of Joonsang?

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:03.060
How close were you two?

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:05.140
Were you friends?

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:06.520
According to Joonsang, you two were...

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:09.560
F-Father...

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:13.400
Don't worry about it, go on back inside.

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:22.280
Yujin...

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:24.490
Yujin...

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:31.040
Why isn't Yujin here?

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:35.550
You still haven't called her?

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:37.700
Why isn't the girl who should have been here before anyone else

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:39.510
still not here?

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:43.700
Tell me.

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:45.720
Did those two really break up?

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:47.810
Yeah, as far as I know.

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:49.310
Why?

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:54.100
He said it was hard to keep ignoring his mother's opposition,

00:18:54.100 --> 00:18:56.190
and that maybe he didn't love her after all.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:58.820
That maybe it had all been a mistake.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.800
Is that what Joonsang said?

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:02.240
That it "wasn't love"?

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:03.990
Yeah.

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:07.880
How could he not call it love,

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:10.580
when he's unconscious and still calling out her name?

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:13.950
What is it?

00:19:13.950 --> 00:19:15.750
What's he hiding from me?

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:19.220
You know what it is, don't you?

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:31.770
They're siblings.

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:35.020
They're what?

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:39.530
They have the same biological father.

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:44.530
Joonsang is Ms. Mi Hee and Yujin's father's son.

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:05.550
You're awake.

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:10.560
Yeah, I guess I am.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:13.730
I wish I never woke up.

00:20:14.140 --> 00:20:15.080
Pardon?

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:29.620
They don't have the results of the tests back yet.

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:31.000
You must be hungry.

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:32.580
I'll get you some breakfast.

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:36.750
How did you know I was here?

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:41.760
I've been waiting here so I could eat with you.

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:56.100
Thanks, Chelin.

00:20:57.640 --> 00:20:58.950
Get some rest.

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:00.020
I'm leaving now.

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:09.120
Why aren't you just up front about it with Yujin?

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:12.750
Just run away with her.

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:15.150
You didn't know, right?

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:17.170
You guys had no way of knowing.

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:19.590
What are you supposed to do?

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:22.130
It's not like you two met and fell in love knowing all this!

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:24.420
What are you supposed to do?

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:26.590
When did you find out?

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:29.350
Did Sanghyuk tell you?

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:33.850
I really wanted you and Yujin to break up.

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:37.930
But how can you expect me to be happy

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:39.360
if <i>this</i> is how you two are going to part ways?

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:43.690
If you leave Yujin like this,

00:21:43.910 --> 00:21:46.820
and I end up never seeing you again as a result,

00:21:48.230 --> 00:21:50.370
then how am I supposed to ask you to come back to me?

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:55.660
Why aren't you saying anything?

00:21:56.580 --> 00:21:59.420
Say something, Joonsang!

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:04.420
So you're not calling me "Minhyung" anymore, huh?

00:22:05.840 --> 00:22:08.180
That's right, Joonsang.

00:22:14.900 --> 00:22:15.980
Daddy.

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:21.230
I had a dream.

00:22:21.560 --> 00:22:25.400
Joonsang and I were here as man and wife to say "hello" to you.

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:28.780
We even sat here and drank together,

00:22:29.520 --> 00:22:32.950
and showed you that we were a good couple.

00:22:36.300 --> 00:22:38.710
And then we stayed like that for a long time...

00:22:39.210 --> 00:22:40.880
For a very long time...

00:22:45.550 --> 00:22:48.550
I must have liked Joonsang so much

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:53.100
because we were one from the start, weren't we?

00:22:53.800 --> 00:22:55.220
That's why I liked him, right, Daddy?

00:22:57.620 --> 00:23:01.310
I guess I shouldn't dream anymore.

00:23:02.110 --> 00:23:04.070
Should I, Daddy?

00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:16.740
Aren't you tired?

00:23:16.990 --> 00:23:18.250
Not at all.

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:19.750
What about you, honey?

00:23:19.860 --> 00:23:21.170
I'm fine.

00:23:22.060 --> 00:23:23.750
I <i>am</i> a man, you know.

00:23:24.880 --> 00:23:26.590
Your father will be happy, I bet.

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:29.510
Yeah, he'll be happy that I brought such a pretty girl with me.

00:23:33.820 --> 00:23:34.760
<i>Joonsang...</i>

00:23:37.470 --> 00:23:40.230
<i>Bye, Joonsang.</i>
